of frame length of 200 t-to the predicted, um, predicted Al alphabet from A to Z. Next, we also&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:41.440 --> 01:03:48.560
use an LSTM model, which captures sequential&nbsp;
dependencies to map fr-from hand&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:48.560 --> 01:03:55.160
pose coordinates to the actual word.&nbsp;
